#: btmanager.lua:536
msgid ""
"Bluetooth firmware files are missing.\n"
"\n"
"Your Kobo's Bluetooth chip needs to be initialized by the stock Kobo OS (Nickel) before it can be used in KOReader.\n"
"\n"
"To fix this:\n"
"1. Fully power off your Kobo\n"
"2. Turn it on and boot normally into Nickel\n"
"3. Go to Settings → Bluetooth and turn it ON\n"
"4. If you have Bluetooth headphones, pair them now\n"
"5. Once Bluetooth is working in Nickel, reboot into KOReader\n"
"\n"
"This one-time setup is needed because the Bluetooth firmware configuration is written by Nickel's startup process and is not preserved across KOReader-only reboots."
msgstr ""
"Chýbajú súbory firmvéru Bluetooth.\n"
"\n"
"Bluetooth čip vo vašom Kobo musí najprv inicializovať pôvodný systém Kobo (Nickel), až potom ho možno použiť v KOReaderi.\n"
"\n"
"Riešenie:\n"
"1. Kobo úplne vypnite\n"
"2. Zapnite ho a normálne nabootujte do Nickel\n"
"3. Choďte do Nastavenia → Bluetooth a zapnite ho\n"
"4. Ak máte Bluetooth slúchadlá, spárujte ich teraz\n"
"5. Keď Bluetooth v Nickel funguje, reštartujte do KOReadera\n"
"\n"
"Toto jednorazové nastavenie je potrebné, pretože konfiguráciu firmvéru Bluetooth zapisuje štartovací proces Nickel a pri reštartoch len do KOReadera sa nezachová."

