"Obsah: %2"

#: synccontroller.lua:737
msgid ""
"Neural synthesis in progress...\n"
"This device needs about %1 seconds per sentence."
msgstr ""
"Prebieha neurálna syntéza...\n"
"Toto zariadenie potrebuje asi %1 sekúnd na vetu."

#: synccontroller.lua:740
msgid ""
"Neural synthesis in progress...\n"
"Please wait."
msgstr ""
"Prebieha neurálna syntéza...\n"
"Čakajte, prosím."

#: synccontroller.lua:751
msgid ""
"Piper is still synthesizing.\n"
"For faster playback, switch to the espeak backend in Tools → Audiobook → TTS Engine."
msgstr ""
"Piper ešte syntetizuje.\n"
"Pre rýchlejšie prehrávanie prepnite na backend espeak v Nástroje → Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas → TTS engine."

#: synccontroller.lua:894 synccontroller.lua:2574 ttsengine.lua:1577
msgid "Piper"
msgstr "Piper"

#: synccontroller.lua:894
msgid "sanoTTS"
msgstr "sanoTTS"

#: synccontroller.lua:896 synccontroller.lua:2599
msgid "Starting %1, please wait…"
msgstr "Spúšťam %1, čakajte…"

#: synccontroller.lua:2571 synccontroller.lua:2583
msgid "TTS"
msgstr "TTS"

#: synccontroller.lua:2609
msgid ""
"Still waiting for %1 after 12 seconds.\n"
"\n"
"On-device neural voices (SherpaTTS, VoxSherpa TTS, and similar) often run slower than real time on this e-reader. If nothing plays, this device is probably not suited to that TTS engine; try another system voice."
msgstr ""
"Po 12 sekundách stále čakám na %1.\n"
"\n"
"Neurálne hlasy bežiace v zariadení (SherpaTTS, VoxSherpa TTS a podobné) sú na tejto čítačke často pomalšie ako reálny čas. Ak sa nič neprehrá, toto zariadenie pre daný TTS engine asi nie je vhodné; skúste iný systémový hlas."

#: synccontroller.lua:2644
msgid ""
"No audio from %1 after a long wait.\n"
"\n"
"This e-reader is probably too slow for that on-device neural engine. Open the TTS app once, or switch to another system voice."
msgstr ""
"Ani po dlhom čakaní žiadny zvuk z %1.\n"
"\n"
"Táto čítačka je pre daný neurálny engine asi príliš pomalá. Raz otvorte aplikáciu TTS, alebo prepnite na iný systémový hlas."

#: synccontroller.lua:2653
msgid "The Android TTS engine stopped. Neural voices can be killed for memory; open the TTS app once, then start read-aloud again."
msgstr "Engine Android TTS sa zastavil. Neurálne hlasy môže systém ukončiť kvôli pamäti; raz otvorte aplikáciu TTS a potom znova spustite čítanie nahlas."

#: synccontroller.lua:2744
msgid "low-resource mode"
msgstr "úsporný režim"

#: synccontroller.lua:2745
msgid "sentence splitting"
msgstr "delenie viet"

#: synccontroller.lua:2749
msgid ""
"Piper is synthesizing slower than playback (%1x realtime).\n"
"Applying %2 to compensate (this session only)."
msgstr ""
"Piper syntetizuje pomalšie ako prehrávanie (%1x reálneho času).\n"
"Na kompenzáciu zapínam: %2 (len pre túto reláciu)."

#: synccontroller.lua:2771
msgid ""
"This device is too slow for Piper voices.\n"
"Switching to espeak for this session.\n"
"Piper will be tried again the next time you start playback."
msgstr ""
"Toto zariadenie je na hlasy Piper príliš pomalé.\n"
"Pre túto reláciu prepínam na espeak.\n"
"Piper sa znova vyskúša pri ďalšom spustení prehrávania."

#: synccontroller.lua:2809
msgid "it still had not produced any audio after %1 espeak sentences"
msgstr "ani po %1 vetách espeak stále nevytvoril žiadny zvuk"

#: synccontroller.lua:2814
msgid "it still had not produced any audio after %1 minutes of espeak fallback"
msgstr "ani po %1 minútach náhradného espeak stále nevytvoril žiadny zvuk"

#: synccontroller.lua:2827
msgid ""
"Piper neural TTS could not keep up on this device: %1.\n"
"\n"
"Switching to espeak for the rest of this session. Piper will be tried again the next time you start playback. To keep espeak permanently, select it in:\n"
"  Audiobook > Voice settings > TTS engine"
msgstr ""
"Neurálne TTS Piper na tomto zariadení nestíha: %1.\n"
"\n"
"Pre zvyšok relácie prepínam na espeak. Piper sa znova vyskúša pri ďalšom spustení prehrávania. Ak chcete espeak natrvalo, zvoľte ho v:\n"
"  Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas > Nastavenia hlasu > TTS engine"

#: ttsengine.lua:494
msgid ""
"No TTS engine available on this device.\n"
"\n"
"The Android TTS helper (.dex) was not found at the expected path.\n"
"\n"
"Please verify that tts_helper.dex exists inside the plugin's android/ folder.\n"
"\n"
"As a workaround, install espeak-ng via Termux:\n"
"  pkg install espeak-ng\n"
"\n"
"Then add Termux to your PATH before launching KOReader."
msgstr ""
"Na tomto zariadení nie je dostupný žiadny TTS engine.\n"
"\n"
"Pomocník Android TTS (.dex) sa nenašiel na očakávanej ceste.\n"
"\n"
"Overte, či tts_helper.dex existuje v priečinku android/ pluginu.\n"
"\n"
"Ako obchádzku nainštalujte espeak-ng cez Termux:\n"
"  pkg install espeak-ng\n"
"\n"
"Potom pred spustením KOReadera pridajte Termux do PATH."

#: ttsengine.lua:507
msgid ""
"No TTS engine found.\n"
"\n"
"Voice model files were found but the TTS binaries (espeak-ng, piper) are missing.\n"
"\n"
"Please download the .zip file (audiobook-koplugin-v*.zip) from:\n"
"https://github.com/stradichenko/audiobook.koplugin/releases/latest\n"
"\n"
"Do not download 'Source code' -- it does not include the TTS engines.\n"
"\n"
"If you already installed from the .zip, please generate a bug report from the plugin menu and post it on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Nenašiel sa žiadny TTS engine.\n"
"\n"
"Súbory hlasových modelov sa našli, ale TTS programy (espeak-ng, piper) chýbajú.\n"
"\n"
"Stiahnite súbor .zip (audiobook-koplugin-v*.zip) z:\n"
"https://github.com/stradichenko/audiobook.koplugin/releases/latest\n"
"\n"
"Nesťahujte 'Source code' -- neobsahuje TTS enginy.\n"
"\n"
"Ak ste už inštalovali zo .zip, vygenerujte z menu pluginu hlásenie o chybe a zverejnite ho na GitHube."

#: ttsengine.lua:509
msgid "No TTS engine found. Please install espeak-ng."
msgstr "Nenašiel sa žiadny TTS engine. Nainštalujte espeak-ng."

#: ttsengine.lua:661
msgid ""
"No TTS engine available.\n"
"\n"
"On Kobo/Kindle, install espeak-ng or use the pre-built release.\n"
"On Android, TTS is not yet supported.\n"
"\n"
"See README for details."
msgstr ""
"Nie je dostupný žiadny TTS engine.\n"
"\n"
"Na Kobo/Kindle nainštalujte espeak-ng alebo použite predpripravené vydanie.\n"
"Na Androide TTS zatiaľ nie je podporované.\n"
"\n"
"Podrobnosti v README."

#: ttsengine.lua:1233
msgid "TTS backend error: Cannot create synthesis command."
msgstr "Chyba TTS backendu: nedá sa vytvoriť príkaz na syntézu."

#: ttsengine.lua:1310
msgid ""
"Piper voice model is incompatible with this device (ONNX Runtime error).\n"
"\n"
"Switching to espeak-ng. You can select a different voice in Audiobook settings."
msgstr ""
"Hlasový model Piper nie je kompatibilný s týmto zariadením (chyba ONNX Runtime).\n"
"\n"
"Prepínam na espeak-ng. Iný hlas môžete zvoliť v nastaveniach pluginu."

#: ttsengine.lua:1395
msgid ""
"TTS synthesis failed.\n"
"\n"
"Could not generate audio file.\n"
"\n"
"Common causes:\n"
"• The TTS engine is not installed\n"
"• /tmp or /var is full (reboot to clear)\n"
"• Insufficient free memory"
msgstr ""
"TTS syntéza zlyhala.\n"
"\n"
"Nepodarilo sa vytvoriť audiosúbor.\n"
"\n"
"Časté príčiny:\n"
"• TTS engine nie je nainštalovaný\n"
"• /tmp alebo /var je plné (reštart ho vyčistí)\n"
"• Nedostatok voľnej pamäte"

#: ttsengine.lua:1397
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Error output:\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Chybový výstup:\n"

#: ttsengine.lua:1559
msgid "Detecting…"
msgstr "Zisťujem…"

#: ttsengine.lua:1560
msgid "Not detected"
msgstr "Nezistené"

#: ttsengine.lua:1563 ttsengine.lua:1569
msgid "SherpaTTS"
msgstr "SherpaTTS"

#: ttsengine.lua:1565
msgid "VoxSherpa TTS"
msgstr "VoxSherpa TTS"

#: ttsengine.lua:1571
msgid "Google"
msgstr "Google"

#: ttsengine.lua:1572
msgid "Samsung"
msgstr "Samsung"

#: ttsengine.lua:1576
msgid "RHVoice"
msgstr "RHVoice"

#: ttsengine.lua:1579
msgid "Unknown (%1)"
msgstr "Neznámy (%1)"

#: ttsengine.lua:1693
msgid ""
"Android TTS: no voice available for %1.\n"
"Install the matching voice data in Android's Text-to-speech settings, or pick a different language in Voice settings."
msgstr ""
"Android TTS: pre %1 nie je dostupný žiadny hlas.\n"
"Nainštalujte zodpovedajúce hlasové dáta v nastaveniach Prevodu textu na reč v Androide, alebo zvoľte iný jazyk v Nastaveniach hlasu."

#: ttsengine.lua:2155
msgid ""
"Bluetooth audio pipeline failed.\n"
"\n"
"Your Kobo's Bluetooth firmware is not initialized. This happens when KOReader is used without first running the stock Kobo OS (Nickel).\n"
"\n"
"To fix this:\n"
"1. Fully power off your Kobo\n"
"2. Turn it on and boot normally into Nickel\n"
"3. Go to Settings → Bluetooth and turn it ON\n"
"4. If you have Bluetooth headphones, pair them now\n"
"5. Once Bluetooth is working in Nickel, reboot into KOReader\n"
"\n"
"Read-along audio playback has been stopped."
msgstr ""
"Bluetooth zvuková pipeline zlyhala.\n"
"\n"
"Firmvér Bluetooth vo vašom Kobo nie je inicializovaný. Stáva sa to, keď sa KOReader používa bez predchádzajúceho spustenia pôvodného systému Kobo (Nickel).\n"
"\n"
"Riešenie:\n"
"1. Kobo úplne vypnite\n"
"2. Zapnite ho a normálne nabootujte do Nickel\n"
"3. Choďte do Nastavenia → Bluetooth a zapnite ho\n"
"4. Ak máte Bluetooth slúchadlá, spárujte ich teraz\n"
"5. Keď Bluetooth v Nickel funguje, reštartujte do KOReadera\n"
"\n"
"Prehrávanie čítania bolo zastavené."

#: ttsengine.lua:2205
msgid "No audio file to play."
msgstr "Nie je čo prehrať."

#: ttsengine.lua:2228 ttsengine.lua:2327
msgid ""
"No audio output available.\n"
"\n"
"This Kindle model has a built-in speaker, but no working audio device was found.\n"
"\n"
"Please generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on the GitHub issue."
msgstr ""
"Nie je dostupný žiadny zvukový výstup.\n"
"\n"
"Tento model Kindle má vstavaný reproduktor, ale nenašlo sa funkčné zvukové zariadenie.\n"
"\n"
"Vygenerujte hlásenie o chybe (Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas > Vygenerovať hlásenie o chybe) a zdieľajte ho v GitHub issue."

#: ttsengine.lua:2230
msgid ""
"No audio output available.\n"
"\n"
"Kindle has no built-in speaker. Audio needs Bluetooth headphones connected via Kindle Settings.\n"
"\n"
"Please generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on the GitHub issue -- it will help identify the correct audio path for this Kindle model."
msgstr ""
"Nie je dostupný žiadny zvukový výstup.\n"
"\n"
"Kindle nemá vstavaný reproduktor. Zvuk potrebuje Bluetooth slúchadlá pripojené cez Nastavenia Kindle.\n"
"\n"
"Vygenerujte hlásenie o chybe (Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas > Vygenerovať hlásenie o chybe) a zdieľajte ho v GitHub issue -- pomôže určiť správnu zvukovú cestu pre tento model Kindle."

#: ttsengine.lua:2232
msgid ""
"No audio output available.\n"
"\n"
"Kobo has no built-in speaker.\n"
"\n"
"Please pair Bluetooth headphones:\n"
"Settings → Bluetooth → Pair\n"
"\n"
"Then try again."
msgstr ""
"Nie je dostupný žiadny zvukový výstup.\n"
"\n"
"Kobo nemá vstavaný reproduktor.\n"
"\n"
"Spárujte Bluetooth slúchadlá:\n"
"Nastavenia → Bluetooth → Spárovať\n"
"\n"
"Potom skúste znova."

#: ttsengine.lua:2234
msgid ""
"No audio output available.\n"
"\n"
"No working audio path was found on this PocketBook.\n"
"\n"
"Try changing the audio device:\n"
"Audiobook > Audio device settings > System player (InkView)\n"
"\n"
"If that does not help, generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Nie je dostupný žiadny zvukový výstup.\n"
"\n"
"Na tomto PocketBooku sa nenašla funkčná zvuková cesta.\n"
"\n"
"Skúste zmeniť zvukové zariadenie:\n"
"Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas > Nastavenia zvukového zariadenia > Systémový prehrávač (InkView)\n"
"\n"
"Ak to nepomôže, vygenerujte hlásenie o chybe (Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas > Vygenerovať hlásenie o chybe) a zdieľajte ho na GitHube."

#: ttsengine.lua:2236
msgid ""
"No audio output available.\n"
"\n"
"No supported audio player found (aplay, paplay, mpv, mplayer).\n"
"\n"
"If using Bluetooth, make sure headphones are paired and connected."
msgstr ""
"Nie je dostupný žiadny zvukový výstup.\n"
"\n"
"Nenašiel sa žiadny podporovaný prehrávač (aplay, paplay, mpv, mplayer).\n"
"\n"
"Ak používate Bluetooth, uistite sa, že slúchadlá sú spárované a pripojené."

#: ttsengine.lua:2329
msgid ""
"No audio output available.\n"
"\n"
"Kindle has no built-in speaker. Please connect Bluetooth headphones via Kindle Settings, then try again.\n"
"\n"
"If you already have headphones connected, please generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on GitHub — it will help identify the correct audio path for this Kindle model."
msgstr ""
"Nie je dostupný žiadny zvukový výstup.\n"
"\n"
"Kindle nemá vstavaný reproduktor. Pripojte Bluetooth slúchadlá cez Nastavenia Kindle a skúste znova.\n"
"\n"
"Ak už máte slúchadlá pripojené, vygenerujte hlásenie o chybe (Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas > Vygenerovať hlásenie o chybe) a zdieľajte ho na GitHube — pomôže určiť správnu zvukovú cestu pre tento model Kindle."

#: ttsengine.lua:2331 ttsengine.lua:6594
msgid ""
"No audio output available.\n"
"\n"
"This device has no built-in speaker. Please connect a Bluetooth audio device first:\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to Audiobook > Bluetooth settings > Bluetooth\n"
"2. Turn Bluetooth on\n"
"3. Scan and pair your headphones/speaker\n"
"4. Then start read-along again."
msgstr ""
"Nie je dostupný žiadny zvukový výstup.\n"
"\n"
"Toto zariadenie nemá vstavaný reproduktor. Najprv pripojte Bluetooth zvukové zariadenie:\n"
"\n"
"1. Choďte do Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas > Nastavenia Bluetooth > Bluetooth\n"
"2. Zapnite Bluetooth\n"
"3. Vyhľadajte a spárujte slúchadlá/reproduktor\n"
"4. Potom znova spustite čítanie."

#: ttsengine.lua:2425
msgid ""
"No Bluetooth headphones detected.\n"
"\n"
"This Kindle has no built-in speaker. Connect Bluetooth headphones in Settings → Wi-Fi & Bluetooth before playing."
msgstr ""
"Nenašli sa žiadne Bluetooth slúchadlá.\n"
"\n"
"Tento Kindle nemá vstavaný reproduktor. Pred prehrávaním pripojte Bluetooth slúchadlá v Nastavenia → Wi-Fi a Bluetooth."

#: ttsengine.lua:2490
msgid ""
"No audio output available.\n"
"\n"
"On this PocketBook, direct ALSA playback can damage the audio subsystem. Please connect Bluetooth headphones first, then try again."
msgstr ""
"Nie je dostupný žiadny zvukový výstup.\n"
"\n"
"Na tomto PocketBooku môže priame prehrávanie cez ALSA poškodiť zvukový subsystém. Najprv pripojte Bluetooth slúchadlá a skúste znova."

#: ttsengine.lua:2590
msgid ""
"Using Kindle's built-in voice.\n"
"\n"
"Your Kindle model's audio system cannot play the selected voice (espeak-ng or Piper).  Falling back to the Kindle's native Ivona TTS, which works on all Kindle models.\n"
"\n"
"Word highlighting may be slightly less precise with the built-in voice."
msgstr ""
"Používa sa vstavaný hlas Kindle.\n"
"\n"
"Zvukový systém vášho modelu Kindle nevie prehrať zvolený hlas (espeak-ng alebo Piper). Prechádzam na natívne Ivona TTS Kindle, ktoré funguje na všetkých modeloch Kindle.\n"
"\n"
"Zvýrazňovanie slov môže byť so vstavaným hlasom o niečo menej presné."

#: ttsengine.lua:2870
msgid ""
"Kindle native TTS failed.\n"
"\n"
"The text-to-speech helper binary could not be executed. Please generate a bug report and share it on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Natívne TTS Kindle zlyhalo.\n"
"\n"
"Pomocný program pre prevod textu na reč sa nepodarilo spustiť. Vygenerujte hlásenie o chybe a zdieľajte ho na GitHube."

#: ttsengine.lua:2882
msgid ""
"Kindle native TTS failed.\n"
"\n"
"The text-to-speech engine could not produce audio. Please generate a bug report and share it on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Natívne TTS Kindle zlyhalo.\n"
"\n"
"Engine prevodu textu na reč nevytvoril zvuk. Vygenerujte hlásenie o chybe a zdieľajte ho na GitHube."

#: ttsengine.lua:3133
msgid ""
"Kindle native TTS failed.\n"
"\n"
"The device has a TTS engine (Ivona SDK) but playback could not be triggered via any strategy (FFI and shell).\n"
"\n"
"Please generate a bug report and share it on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Natívne TTS Kindle zlyhalo.\n"
"\n"
"Zariadenie má TTS engine (Ivona SDK), ale prehrávanie sa nepodarilo spustiť žiadnym spôsobom (FFI ani shell).\n"
"\n"
"Vygenerujte hlásenie o chybe a zdieľajte ho na GitHube."

#: ttsengine.lua:3251
msgid ""
"Audio playback failed on this Kindle model.\n"
"\n"
"The ttssrc TTS pipeline could not start. Please generate a bug report and share it on the GitHub issue."
msgstr ""
"Prehrávanie zvuku na tomto modeli Kindle zlyhalo.\n"
"\n"
"TTS pipeline ttssrc sa nepodarilo spustiť. Vygenerujte hlásenie o chybe a zdieľajte ho v GitHub issue."

#: ttsengine.lua:3510 ttsengine.lua:3605
msgid ""
"Kindle audio playback failed.\n"
"\n"
"The playermgr service accepted commands but audio never started.\n"
"\n"
"Possible causes:\n"
"1. GStreamer cannot find the wavparse plugin on this firmware\n"
"2. audiomgrd denied audio focus to the plugin\n"
"3. No audio sink is configured (built-in speaker absent, BT not connected)\n"
"\n"
"Try: Connect Bluetooth headphones via Kindle Settings first, then start read-along.\n"
"\n"
"If this persists, please generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Prehrávanie zvuku na Kindle zlyhalo.\n"
"\n"
"Služba playermgr prijala príkazy, ale zvuk sa nikdy nespustil.\n"
"\n"
"Možné príčiny:\n"
"1. GStreamer na tomto firmvéri nenachádza plugin wavparse\n"
"2. audiomgrd odmietol pluginu pridelenie zvuku\n"
"3. Nie je nastavený žiadny zvukový výstup (chýba vstavaný reproduktor, BT nie je pripojené)\n"
"\n"
"Skúste: najprv pripojte Bluetooth slúchadlá cez Nastavenia Kindle, potom spustite čítanie.\n"
"\n"
"Ak to pretrváva, vygenerujte hlásenie o chybe (Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas > Vygenerovať hlásenie o chybe) a zdieľajte ho na GitHube."

#: ttsengine.lua:3603
msgid ""
"Kindle audio playback failed.\n"
"\n"
"This Kindle model's GStreamer installation cannot decode audio files (no wavparse plugin). Audio may work if:\n"
"\n"
"1. You have connected Bluetooth headphones via Kindle Settings\n"
"2. VoiceView is enabled (Settings > Accessibility > VoiceView)\n"
"3. You switch to espeak TTS backend (Audiobook > Voice settings > TTS engine)\n"
"\n"
"Please generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Prehrávanie zvuku na Kindle zlyhalo.\n"
"\n"
"Inštalácia GStreamer na tomto modeli Kindle nevie dekódovať audiosúbory (chýba plugin wavparse). Zvuk môže fungovať, ak:\n"
"\n"
"1. Máte pripojené Bluetooth slúchadlá cez Nastavenia Kindle\n"
"2. Je zapnutý VoiceView (Nastavenia > Zjednodušenie ovládania > VoiceView)\n"
"3. Prepnete na backend espeak (Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas > Nastavenia hlasu > TTS engine)\n"
"\n"
"Vygenerujte hlásenie o chybe (Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas > Vygenerovať hlásenie o chybe) a zdieľajte ho na GitHube."

#: ttsengine.lua:3781
msgid ""
"Audio playback failed on this Kindle model.\n"
"\n"
"The pipeline reached the audio mixer but no sound was produced. On newer Kindle firmware there is no ALSA sound card and audio must leave the device through Amazon's audio manager, so this is usually a firmware audio-route change rather than a missing component. The bug report runs pipeline tests that identify the cause.\n"
"\n"
"Please generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on the GitHub issue."
msgstr ""
"Prehrávanie zvuku na tomto modeli Kindle zlyhalo.\n"
"\n"
"Pipeline sa dostala k zvukovému mixéru, ale nevznikol žiadny zvuk. Novší firmvér Kindle nemá zvukovú kartu ALSA a zvuk musí zo zariadenia odísť cez zvukového manažéra Amazonu, takže ide zvyčajne o zmenu zvukovej cesty vo firmvéri, nie o chýbajúci komponent. Hlásenie o chybe spustí testy pipeline, ktoré príčinu určia.\n"
"\n"
"Vygenerujte hlásenie o chybe (Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas > Vygenerovať hlásenie o chybe) a zdieľajte ho v GitHub issue."

#: ttsengine.lua:3852
msgid ""
"Audio playback failed on this Kindle model.\n"
"\n"
"The GStreamer audio pipeline could not start"
msgstr ""
"Prehrávanie zvuku na tomto modeli Kindle zlyhalo.\n"
"\n"
"Zvukovú pipeline GStreamer sa nepodarilo spustiť"

#: ttsengine.lua:3858
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"This is often a system library compatibility issue. Try connecting Bluetooth headphones via Kindle Settings, switch to the espeak backend (Tools → Audiobook → Voice settings → TTS engine), or generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on the GitHub issue."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Často ide o problém s kompatibilitou systémových knižníc. Skúste pripojiť Bluetooth slúchadlá cez Nastavenia Kindle, prepnúť na backend espeak (Nástroje → Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas → Nastavenia hlasu → TTS engine), alebo vygenerujte hlásenie o chybe (Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas > Vygenerovať hlásenie o chybe) a zdieľajte ho v GitHub issue."

#: ttsengine.lua:6437
msgid ""
"Bluetooth audio not connected.\n"
"\n"
"Please make sure your Bluetooth headphones or speaker are:\n"
"\n"
"1. Powered on\n"
"2. Paired in Kobo Settings → Bluetooth\n"
"3. Connected and within range\n"
"\n"
"Then try again."
msgstr ""
"Bluetooth zvuk nie je pripojený.\n"
"\n"
"Uistite sa, že vaše Bluetooth slúchadlá alebo reproduktor sú:\n"
"\n"
"1. Zapnuté\n"
"2. Spárované v Nastavenia Kobo → Bluetooth\n"
"3. Pripojené a v dosahu\n"
"\n"
"Potom skúste znova."

#: ttsengine.lua:6539
msgid "The audio player keeps crashing, playback was stopped."
msgstr "Prehrávač zvuku opakovane padá, prehrávanie bolo zastavené."

#: ttsengine.lua:6540
msgid "Last error:"
msgstr "Posledná chyba:"

#: ttsengine.lua:6542
msgid "Please generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on GitHub."
msgstr "Vygenerujte hlásenie o chybe (Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas > Vygenerovať hlásenie o chybe) a zdieľajte ho na GitHube."

#: ttsengine.lua:6590
msgid ""
"No audio output available.\n"
"\n"
"Kindle has no built-in speaker. Audio needs Bluetooth headphones connected via Kindle Settings.\n"
"\n"
"The Kindle audio subsystem did not expose a usable ALSA device. Please generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on the GitHub issue -- it will help identify the correct audio path for this Kindle model."
msgstr ""
"Nie je dostupný žiadny zvukový výstup.\n"
"\n"
"Kindle nemá vstavaný reproduktor. Zvuk potrebuje Bluetooth slúchadlá pripojené cez Nastavenia Kindle.\n"
"\n"
"Zvukový subsystém Kindle neposkytol použiteľné zariadenie ALSA. Vygenerujte hlásenie o chybe (Audiokniha – čítanie nahlas > Vygenerovať hlásenie o chybe) a zdieľajte ho v GitHub issue -- pomôže určiť správnu zvukovú cestu pre tento model Kindle."

